[1;36mTEXT BACKDROP[0m

Shows a text file on your desktop, behind every window.

Open its settings from the Extensions app to choose:

  [1mMonitor       [0m[90mwhich screen, or Auto for the left-most[0m
  [1mText file     [0m[90many UTF-8 file; it redraws when the file changes[0m
  [1mAppearance    [0m[90mbackground opacity, padding and margins[0m

Plain text works as-is. ANSI colour codes are drawn in colour:

  [91mred[0m  [92mgreen[0m  [93myellow[0m  [94mblue[0m  [1mbold[0m  [2mdim[0m  [38;2;255;140;0m24-bit orange[0m

